{%- comment -%}
  SPADRA assessment landing page — closing quiz gate.

  Last section on the page, so the CTA is the only exit. The four "what
  happens next" lines are promises the funnel actually keeps: no email wall
  before the result, no card, and a specialist assigned on signup. If any of
  those stops being true, change this copy — an unmet promise here is worse
  than no promise.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="spadra-gate" style="background: {{ section.settings.background_color }};">
  <div class="spadra-gate__inner">
    <h2 class="spadra-gate__heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>

    {%- if section.settings.body != blank -%}
      <div class="spadra-gate__body">{{ section.settings.body }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
      <ul class="spadra-gate__list">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.type == 'promise' -%}
            <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <strong>{{ block.settings.label }}</strong>
              {{ block.settings.detail }}
            </li>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}

    <button type="button" class="spadra-gate__cta" data-spadra-quiz-open>
      {{ section.settings.cta_label }}
    </button>

    {%- if section.settings.reassurance != blank -%}
      <p class="spadra-gate__reassurance">{{ section.settings.reassurance }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.closer != blank -%}
      <p class="spadra-gate__closer">{{ section.settings.closer }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      The second ask, for the minority who read the whole page. They are the
      warmest traffic on the site and the main CTA is now several screens
      behind them, so it is repeated rather than left to a scroll back up.
      Deliberately quieter than the primary button: someone who read this far
      does not need to be sold again, only given the door.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if section.settings.encore_heading != blank -%}
      <div class="spadra-gate__encore">
        <p class="spadra-gate__encore-heading">{{ section.settings.encore_heading }}</p>
        {%- if section.settings.encore_body != blank -%}
          <p class="spadra-gate__encore-body">{{ section.settings.encore_body }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <button type="button" class="spadra-gate__encore-cta" data-spadra-quiz-open>
          {{ section.settings.encore_cta_label }}
        </button>
        {%- if section.settings.encore_note != blank -%}
          <p class="spadra-gate__encore-note">{{ section.settings.encore_note }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  .spadra-gate { padding: 96px 24px; }
  .spadra-gate__inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .spadra-gate__heading {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4.2vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
  }
  .spadra-gate__body { font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.65; color: #334155; }
  .spadra-gate__body p { margin: 0 0 14px; }

  .spadra-gate__list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 34px 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .spadra-gate__list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 26px;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #334155;
  }
  .spadra-gate__list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 4px;
    top: 0.6em;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #0F766E;
  }

  .spadra-gate__cta {
    appearance: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: #0B1220;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 18px 38px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .spadra-gate__cta:hover { background: #16233c; }

  .spadra-gate__reassurance {
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: #64748B;
  }
  .spadra-gate__closer {
    margin: 40px 0 0;
    font-size: 1.06rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  .spadra-gate__encore {
    margin: 56px auto 0;
    padding: 34px 28px;
    max-width: 560px;
    border-top: 1px solid #DCD8D0;
  }
  .spadra-gate__encore-heading {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: 1.22rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .spadra-gate__encore-body {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #475569;
  }
  .spadra-gate__encore-cta {
    appearance: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: transparent;
    color: #0B1220;
    border: 1.5px solid #0B1220;
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 14px 30px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .spadra-gate__encore-cta:hover { background: #0B1220; color: #FFFFFF; }
  .spadra-gate__encore-note {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #64748B;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .spadra-gate { padding: 72px 20px; }
    .spadra-gate__encore { padding: 30px 0 0; }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Assessment: final CTA",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "You can keep guessing. Or you can spend 60 seconds and know." },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Body",
      "default": "<p>Every week you run the generic protocol is a week you're solving for the wrong variable. Maybe your bottleneck is cognitive and you've been buying electrolytes. Maybe it's hepatic, and you've been treating a morning symptom while the actual load compounds quietly.</p><p>The assessment costs you a minute and tells you which it is.</p>"
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_label", "label": "CTA label", "default": "Start Your 60-Second Lifestyle Assessment" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "reassurance", "label": "Under-button reassurance", "default": "No credit card. No email required to see your result. If you continue, it's $44.99 for a 30-day supply \u2014 a one-time order, not a subscription." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "closer", "label": "Closing line", "default": "You've already optimized your sleep, your calendar and your codebase. This is the last unoptimized variable." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "encore_heading", "label": "Second ask: heading", "default": "You read the whole thing." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "encore_body", "label": "Second ask: body", "default": "Which means you already suspect the generic packet isn't solving your problem. One minute settles it — and you'll know which of the three protocols is actually yours before you spend anything." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "encore_cta_label", "label": "Second ask: CTA label", "default": "Fine — Show Me My Protocol" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "encore_note", "label": "Second ask: note", "default": "About a minute · no email, no card" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background_color", "label": "Background color", "default": "#F8F7F4" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "promise",
      "name": "Promise",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Label", "default": "60 seconds." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "detail", "label": "Detail", "default": "Five questions \u2014 a few more only if your answers call for them." }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Assessment: final CTA",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "promise", "settings": { "label": "60 seconds.", "detail": "Five questions \u2014 a few more only if your answers call for them." } },
        { "type": "promise", "settings": { "label": "Your result, immediately.", "detail": "The protocol you match to, and the reasoning behind it." } },
        { "type": "promise", "settings": { "label": "No email wall.", "detail": "See your match before you decide anything." } },
        { "type": "promise", "settings": { "label": "Your specialist, matched.", "detail": "If you start, a real person is assigned to you in week one." } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
